# .claude/agents/

This directory is intentionally empty of specialist `.md` agent files.

VS Code Copilot custom agent discovery uses a single picker-facing entry point:
- `.github/agents/CORTEX.agent.md`

Specialist capabilities remain available through delegated specifications in:
- `.github/agents/core/`
- `.github/agents/support/`

This prevents duplicate agent picker entries from dual-directory discovery.
